BT /F1 10 Tf 56 644 Td (This is a preliminary SEV2 incident report. On 2026-03-12, card-gateway authorization requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 630 Td (experienced a timeout of 8 seconds, causing payment processing failures. The Card Gateway team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 616 Td (identified slow responses from NorthBank as the likely cause and escalated to the NorthBank) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 602 Td (operations desk for investigation. The full postmortem is documented in INC-301.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 580 Td (Impact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 560 Td (Merchants were unable to process card payments during the incident window. Authorization) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 546 Td (requests to NorthBank failed when responses exceeded the timeout of 8 seconds threshold,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 532 Td (resulting in declined transactions and degraded service availability.) Tj ET
