BT /F2 12 Tf 56 408 Td (Root Cause) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 388 Td (Slow responses from NorthBank caused authorization requests to exceed the timeout of 8 seconds,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 374 Td (resulting in request failures at card-gateway. The underlying cause at NorthBank's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 360 Td (infrastructure requires further investigation by their operations team.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 338 Td (Resolution) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 318 Td (The Card Gateway team contacted the NorthBank operations desk to investigate the source of slow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 304 Td (responses. NorthBank operations worked to restore normal response times. Authorization timeouts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 290 Td (subsided as NorthBank's performance recovered.) Tj ET
